# 2. Uniforms driven live

<div class="code-path">Code: <code>examples/a2-opengl-uniforms/</code></div>

The objective of this example is to modify the program while it runs, from a panel displayed in the frame. We
start from the cube of [example 1](../02_cube/index.html), subdivided and twisted in its vertex shader. Five
elements can be changed: the twist, the hue, the speed, the light, and a reset button.

The panel is not written in HTML: the page builds it automatically from the parameters that the program
declares.

