## Build and run

- **&gt;** Build the example as in [example 1](../02_cube/index.html#build-and-run), from
  `examples/a2-opengl-uniforms/`.
- **&gt;** On the desktop, run `./build/project --twist 1.2`.
  - *Rem. The panel only exists on the web: the desktop version takes its settings from the command line.*
- **&gt;** On the web, open the slide, and check that the sliders change the box while it rotates.

The address of the frame accepts the following options for the panel:

| In the address | Effect |
|---|---|
| `controls=twist,hue` | the controls of the panel, in this order |
| `compact=1` | short labels, small panel (for a small frame) |
| `panel=tl`, `tr`, `bl`, `br` | the corner of the panel (default `tr`) |

